      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I’m よしたか (Yoshitaka) the developer of TopazChat audio/video streaming service. Thank you for posting this canny. I also want TopazChat to be whitelisted by VRChat.\n\nWe’ve been providing our service since August 2019 for free. Thankfully we have many VRChat users and patrons to keep continuing our service.\n\nOf cause our service don’t collect the sensitive information of our users. The IP addresses are only used to provide our service (responding incoming packets), and logs to solving technical problems, no exposure to any third-party.\n\nOur TopazChat is trusted by many VRChat communities for 4 years long, and supporting many performers by our ultra low latency & high quality audio/video streaming.\n\nPlease add following domains to whitelist:\n\n- topaz.chat for public usage\n\n- *.topaz.chat subdomains for special event purposes.\n\nIf you require more information, please email me at tyounan.moti@gmail.com or DM @TyounanMOTI at X (Twitter)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
