      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5baf6139b49f620eba95cdfa|full_name}: As per as my knowledge of recently added trust domain, all domain owners be business partner and registered business.\n\nSo best bet to archive this be, make partnership agreement with VRChat and ask them to add those domain as per as you required.\n\n(Basically, this is part of corporate relationship department matter)",
