      "value": "This request has been partially implemented it seems?\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/#allowlisted-services\n\nshows that only ciel.topaz.chat is permitted. Unsure if this domain is specific to a particular event or partner.",
